      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The `offerIdentifier` is a string that you provide in App Store Connect when you set up an offer. All offer types (`offerType`) have offer identifiers, except for introductory offers.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreservernotifications/documentation/AppStoreServerNotifications/offerType"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For more information on offer codes, see `supporting-offer-codes-in-your-app`. For more information on promotional offers, see `https://help.apple.com/app-store-connect/#/dev16dfca448`.",
          "refs": [
